---
// Quiz figure for the spacing post (post: spacing-is-a-system).
---
<div class="qfig-uxq03rowpairs">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 170" role="img" aria-label="A toolbar of four items, each a 28px icon followed by a text label (Inbox, Sent, Drafts, Trash). Every gap is 20px, between an icon and its label and between one item and the next. The gaps are shaded.">
<rect x="30" y="70" width="28" height="28" rx="6" class="ico" />
<rect x="58" y="60" width="20" height="48" class="gap" />
<text x="78" y="89" class="lab"><tspan data-lang-en>Inbox</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hộp thư</tspan></text>
<rect x="140" y="60" width="20" height="48" class="gap" />
<rect x="160" y="70" width="28" height="28" rx="6" class="ico" />
<rect x="188" y="60" width="20" height="48" class="gap" />
<text x="208" y="89" class="lab"><tspan data-lang-en>Sent</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đã gửi</tspan></text>
<rect x="258" y="60" width="20" height="48" class="gap" />
<rect x="278" y="70" width="28" height="28" rx="6" class="ico" />
<rect x="306" y="60" width="20" height="48" class="gap" />
<text x="326" y="89" class="lab"><tspan data-lang-en>Drafts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nháp</tspan></text>
<rect x="372" y="60" width="20" height="48" class="gap" />
<rect x="392" y="70" width="28" height="28" rx="6" class="ico" />
<rect x="420" y="60" width="20" height="48" class="gap" />
<text x="440" y="89" class="lab"><tspan data-lang-en>Trash</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thùng rác</tspan></text>
<text x="30" y="140" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Gaps are shaded.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Các khoảng được tô nền.</tspan></text>
<text x="30" y="34" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Toolbar, drawn at real pixel size</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thanh công cụ, vẽ đúng kích thước pixel</tspan></text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-uxq03rowpairs { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-uxq03rowpairs svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-uxq03rowpairs text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-uxq03rowpairs .h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-uxq03rowpairs .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .qfig-uxq03rowpairs .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .qfig-uxq03rowpairs .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-uxq03rowpairs .fld { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-uxq03rowpairs .lab { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
  .qfig-uxq03rowpairs .gap { fill: var(--gold); opacity: 0.35; }
  .qfig-uxq03rowpairs .bar { fill: var(--text-faint); opacity: 0.55; }
  .qfig-uxq03rowpairs .ico { fill: var(--text-muted); opacity: 0.7; }
</style>
